WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:06.319
Tuesday morning. Your crew's out loading, your surveyor's on the road — and the office phone rings.

2
00:00:07.989 --> 00:00:12.535
Meet the Loop AI assistant from reloops — built for busy removals offices.

3
00:00:14.082 --> 00:00:18.106
It answers in your firm's name, takes the move details, and reads back the postcode.

4
00:00:18.906 --> 00:00:24.631
Where a move fits your saved pricing, it shares your guide price — clearly framed as a guide only.

5
00:00:26.928 --> 00:00:32.186
Next, it checks your live diary and books your nearest available surveyor straight in.

6
00:00:32.986 --> 00:00:38.444
Your customer gets a booking text right away — or a link to film a video survey on their phone.

7
00:00:39.793 --> 00:00:45.875
Your office stays in charge: listen in quietly, step straight in, or have callers put through to your staff.

8
00:00:49.613 --> 00:00:56.142
Seconds after hang-up, the call summary, notes and tasks land in your shared Inbox beside WhatsApp.

9
00:00:56.812 --> 00:01:01.515
It also rings back missed callers and new website enquiries so no job slips away.

10
00:01:02.715 --> 00:01:09.491
No calls missed. No jobs lost. Ask us to walk through a move, or visit reloops.co for a closer look.
